actions.job:
A client submitted a form to the EDGE K/U/Th Portal. Process the upload immediately. Read jobs/process-spectra.md and execute all steps using the webhook payload:

job_id={{body.job_id}}
client_name={{body.client_name}}
email={{body.email}}
project={{body.project}}
roi_half_width={{body.roi_half_width}}
normalize_live_time={{body.normalize_live_time}}
measurement_id_column={{body.measurement_id_column}}
spectra_files={{body.spectra_files}}
dose_csv_file={{body.dose_csv_file}}

The .spc files are already saved to edge-kuth-portal/jobs/{{body.job_id}}/spectra/ by the upload server. Do not ask for input — execute all steps autonomously.

A client submitted a gamma/flight-log join job via the web form. Process IMMEDIATELY — no batch delay.

Read jobs/process-join.md and execute all steps using these parameters:

job_id={{body.job_id}}
project_name={{body.project_name}}
client_name={{body.client_name}}
email={{body.email}}
time_tolerance={{body.time_tolerance}}
factory_a0={{body.factory_a0}}
factory_a1={{body.factory_a1}}
factory_a2={{body.factory_a2}}
factory_a3={{body.factory_a3}}
spectrogram_filename={{body.spectrogram_filename}}
spectrogram_b64={{body.spectrogram_b64}}
flightlog_filename={{body.flightlog_filename}}
flightlog_b64={{body.flightlog_b64}}

The input files are base64-encoded in spectrogram_b64 and flightlog_b64. Decode them locally to /tmp, run the join, upload ONLY the output files (joined CSV, calibration.txt, summary.json) to a new job folder in Google Drive. Input files are NOT in Drive — they arrive via this webhook payload. Do not ask for input — execute all steps autonomously.
